  "dcterms:title": "PubChem (compounds, bioassays, and chemical annotations)",
  "dcterms:description": "A BioBricks brick mirroring and re-packaging PubChem data downloaded from the NCBI PubChem FTP site (ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubchem): the CURRENT-Full compound SDF collection, concise BioAssay CSVs and bioassay extras (bioassays/bioactivities/Sid2CidSMILES), and chemical safety/hazard annotations pulled from PubChem PUG-View (via github.com/biobricks-ai/pubchem_annotations). PubChem is an NCBI/NLM aggregator: some content is US-Government public domain, but much is contributed or licensed by third-party depositors who may assert their own copyright and commercial-use restrictions.",
